Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi everyone! I'm Soda,\Nan Alaskan Malamute.\N{\fs42}大家好！我是小苏打，\N一只阿拉斯加犬。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I come from a\Nvery cold place,\N{\fs42}我来自一个非常寒冷的地方，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can run super fast!\N{\fs42}而且我跑得可快啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited\Nto meet you all.\N{\fs42}见到大家，我特别开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my big brother, Jacky.\NHe's a cheerful little chick.\N{\fs42}这是我的哥哥奇奇，\N他是一只开朗的小鸡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is my\Nbig sister, Angela.\NShe's a gentle sheep.\N{\fs42}这位是我的姐姐露露，\N她是一只温柔的绵羊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We live together happily\Nand love each other\Nvery much.\N{\fs42}我们快乐地生活在一起，\N也非常爱彼此。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you like me too!\N{\fs42}希望你们也喜欢我！
